1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:10,490
You know, all of you, and I mean all of you, who consider all violence bad and speaking loud untoward

2
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:20,170
are echoing the sentiments of the same people who called themselves good and civilized

3
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:29,470
while raining terror upon anyone who didn't look like them and calling those folks bad and savage.

4
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:36,030
So when you perpetuate these ideas and when you place them upon others, I want you to know

5
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:42,910
that you're doing the work for them. Get loud and shake tables. Be nothing like them.

